    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Pongo iracundis.</em> A blazing ape elemental whose flames burn hotter the angrier it gets — every heavy blow stokes its rage and upgrades its fire dice, and even death struggles to stick. Habitat: Jungle.</p><p><em>Source: Heliana's Field Notes P-012 (Loot Tavern)</em></p>",
