    {
      "_id": "dtSrnZX5SrQlZlml",
      "_key": "!actors.items!HydBo33ILvnApX7T.dtSrnZX5SrQlZlml",
      "name": "Blazing Rage",
      "img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-carved-stone-green.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "sort": 100,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Whenever the enkon takes 20+ damage in a single instance, its rage level increases by one, up to a maximum of level 5. The die size of the enkon's Fire damage increases with its rage level: d4s at level 1, d6s at level 2, d8s at level 3, d10s at level 4, and d12s at level 5. The enkon's rage decreases by one level, to a minimum of level 1, if the <em>Calm Emotions</em> spell is cast on it or when it goes 24 hours without taking damage.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "type": {
          "value": "monster",
          "subtype": ""
        },
